<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Itausa first half net rises.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Itausa first half net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian financial and industrial conglomerate Itausa, which controls private bank Banco Itau, issued the following statement on its consolidated first half results.</p>
<p>			   H1 1997	  H1 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	  379.3 million	 339.1 million</p>
<p>    Net holding	 168.9 million	 166.7 million</p>
<p>    Shr net holding   54.07 reais     53.37 reais</p>
<p>    Operating rev.     6.17 bln	  6.13 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation. Share profit figures per lot of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
